^3Abilities:
- Jawa Shin Kick ^3[CS3]

Most Jawas were about 1 meter tall, though some grew to 1 and a half meters, and were characterized by their brown robes, glowing yellow eyes, and quickly spoken language called Jawaese that included words such as Utinni!"